.vscode/**
src/**
test/**
tsconfig.json
.gitignore
*.vsix
# No `node_modules/**` here on purpose: the compiled extension.js requires
# vscode-languageclient at activation and tsc does not bundle it, so vsce
# must bundle the runtime dependency (it bundles exactly the packages listed
# in `dependencies`). A blanket `node_modules/**` here silently broke that —
# test/package.test.mjs asserts the package still carries it.
